Package: termr
Title: Modern Reactive Terminal Applications with Data Workflows
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Akims", "Mensikovs", email = "akimm7926@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Build modern reactive terminal applications for data workflows
    in R using composable widgets, layouts, events, focus management and
    themes. A virtual framebuffer and incremental rendering update changed
    cells, while a headless driver supports deterministic application tests.
    Includes virtualised data tables, lazy table sources, data inspection,
    SQL editing and background R workers with progress and streamed output.
    Optional database integrations and static text, Markdown, HTML, SVG and
    JSON exports support analytical tools and reports without requiring an
    interactive terminal for static output.
